# Every text file checks out with LF, on every platform.
#
# This is not a style preference. Clause B4 byte-compares the committed
# packages/ame-tokens/tokens.css against a fresh build, and build.mjs emits LF.
# Without this line a Windows clone converts the committed file to CRLF, the
# comparison fails on a tree nobody touched, and the first thing a new adopter
# sees is a gate that says their checkout is broken. Caught by running the
# smoke test on a fresh clone, which is what smoke tests are for.
* text=auto eol=lf
